{"title":"a raven waiting for a storm","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/a-raven-waiting-for-a-storm","date":1755535323000,"content":" \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/03545bd0-bb49-4738-bc78-1bca587be1eb/raven3.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/03545bd0-bb49-4738-bc78-1bca587be1eb/raven3.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/03545bd0-bb49-4738-bc78-1bca587be1eb/raven3.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/03545bd0-bb49-4738-bc78-1bca587be1eb/raven3.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/03545bd0-bb49-4738-bc78-1bca587be1eb/raven3.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/03545bd0-bb49-4738-bc78-1bca587be1eb/raven3.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/03545bd0-bb49-4738-bc78-1bca587be1eb/raven3.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/03545bd0-bb49-4738-bc78-1bca587be1eb/raven3.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\"><em>visual art</em></a><em> | </em><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\"><em>sketchbook</em></a><em> | </em><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/birds\"><em>birds</em></a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr />\n\n\n  <p>I drew this raven last week — on the kind of day when I had no cognitive capacity for anything else. drawing always feels like its own kind of meditation. you can turn off your thinking brain and focus just on light and shadow, form and void. </p><p>more and more lately, I’ve been in the mood to draw animals — as if each of them could come alive, off the page, to keep me company. the animals come from my imagination, through my hands, and belong to me. I choose the raven as my bird for <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/drawing-ravens-as-threshold-guides\" target=\"_blank\">navigating threshold consciousness</a>. </p><p>this is raven no. 2. it is both a symbol of beckoning and surrender. perhaps, together, we are waiting for a storm, for something to happen. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7b5dfa5f-d4a8-4a37-89da-c6ea1c27600e/raven6.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"3660\" height=\"2745\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7b5dfa5f-d4a8-4a37-89da-c6ea1c27600e/raven6.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7b5dfa5f-d4a8-4a37-89da-c6ea1c27600e/raven6.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/7b5dfa5f-d4a